  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Affordable luxury by the beach at an exceptional price! \r\n\r\nAn outstanding opportunity presents itself within Waipapa, Mairangi Bay. \r\n\r\nApartment 2 is our last brand new one bedroom apartment and is ideal for those seeking to downsize, obtain a lock up and leave or acquire a savvy investment option. \r\n\r\n58m2 floor area with a substantial 12m2 deck making a total of 70m2 (more or less) capturing beautiful afternoon sun and the deck is covered and ideal for entertaining.  Two lifts service both sides of the building, separated by a sunny residents only, open air courtyard.  Excellent appliances and internal specification along with a 2.7m ceiling height allowing extra light and space throughout your apartment. \r\n\r\nSafe and secure with intercom and swipe card access. \r\n\r\nLife could not be easier!  Situated in the heart of Mairangi Bay, with local retail, supermarket, restaurants and cafes, tennis club, bowling club and of course our very special beach and walks, just moments away.  \r\n\r\nA 10% deposit will secure your new home with the balance payable on settlement. \r\n\r\nPets are allowed subject to Body Corp approval and a rental appraisal is also available.",
